Dialogue: 1,0:23:20.00,0:23:23.63,OP - CN,,0,900,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}面對無人可知的明天
Dialogue: 1,0:23:23.63,0:23:27.28,OP - CN,,0,900,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}只需聽從內心的聲音
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.28,0:23:30.90,OP - CN,,0,900,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}去奔跑  去超越
